              "id": "CVE-2019-9948",
              "name": "OsPackageVulnerability",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "python: Undocumented local_file protocol allows remote attackers to bypass protection mechanisms"
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "urllib in Python 2.x through 2.7.16 supports the local_file: scheme, which makes it easier for remote attackers to bypass protection mechanisms that blacklist file: URIs, as demonstrated by triggering a urllib.urlopen('local_file:///etc/passwd') call."
              },
